WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:32.752
The king and queen sat on their thrones.

2
00:00:32.752 --> 00:00:36.453
Prince Eric stared at his lessons.

3
00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:38.890
He was grumpy.

4
00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:41.733
"Tom," he whispered.

5
00:00:41.733 --> 00:00:44.916
"Help me finish my lessons."

6
00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:47.955
Tom looked at the prince's paper.

7
00:00:47.955 --> 00:00:51.473
It was filled with math problems.

8
00:00:51.473 --> 00:00:57.998
"Use magic!" whispered the prince.

9
00:00:57.998 --> 00:01:00.258
Tom lifted his wand.

10
00:01:00.258 --> 00:01:04.615
"No, Tom!" The queen glared at him.

11
00:01:04.615 --> 00:01:08.136
"The prince must do his own work.

12
00:01:08.136 --> 00:01:11.215
Someday he will be the king."

13
00:01:11.215 --> 00:01:13.452
Prince Eric grinned.

14
00:01:13.452 --> 00:01:18.024
"Then I won't have to work!" he said.

15
00:01:18.024 --> 00:01:21.446
The king frowned. "What?"

16
00:01:21.446 --> 00:01:25.252
"Kings work very hard!" Tom said quickly.

17
00:01:25.252 --> 00:01:28.129
The king puffed out his chest.

18
00:01:28.129 --> 00:01:31.665
"Indeed!" he said proudly.

19
00:01:31.665 --> 00:01:33.625
The prince shrugged.

20
00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:37.266
"Then I won't be the king," he said.

21
00:01:37.266 --> 00:01:39.773
The queen scowled.

22
00:01:39.773 --> 00:01:44.586
"Finish your lessons," she said.

23
00:01:44.586 --> 00:01:49.494
"I won't!" the prince cried.

24
00:01:49.494 --> 00:01:52.195
He ran from the room.

25
00:01:52.195 --> 00:01:55.415
The queen sighed.

26
00:01:55.415 --> 00:02:09.969
"Wizard, bring him back," she said.

27
00:02:09.969 --> 00:02:13.937
Tom went to the prince's room.

28
00:02:13.937 --> 00:02:21.365
The window was open.

29
00:02:21.365 --> 00:02:33.062
"I see a note!" Cat said.

30
00:02:33.062 --> 00:02:38.850
Tom brought the note to the queen.

31
00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:41.908
"What does it say?" the king asked.

32
00:02:41.908 --> 00:02:44.124
The queen read the note:

33
00:02:44.124 --> 00:02:46.504
I want an easy job.

34
00:02:46.504 --> 00:02:51.157
So Frog and I are running away.

35
00:02:51.166 --> 00:02:53.964
The queen pulled out her handkerchief.

36
00:02:53.964 --> 00:02:58.430
"Find the prince, Tom!" she sobbed loudly.

37
00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:08.554
"Or don't come back!"
